        "slc_51c51ef6b9263417c36d4a8fbb7d851c9755378c47b9d369ce8f895660ef8f8d"
      ],
      "text": "The system uses a modular agent architecture with named agents: PromptDesignerAgent, CodeGeneratorAgent, EvaluatorAgent, DatabaseAgent, SelectionControllerAgent, and a task_manager agent that orchestrates the evolutionary loop and coordinates the others."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_6bf311b4dca724d03b43287b96a02a33c550507a14b64c2b6ee2cdb0e439e31c",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "0389aea0e0a745b61babdc0fdd18ac61098dfa84",
          "git_sha": "52a479e4b19ffa90089f38fbe425bc4b3dbd794f",
          "line_end": 63,
          "line_start": 48,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "shyamsaktawat/openalpha_evolve",
          "url": "https://github.com/shyamsaktawat/OpenAlpha_Evolve/blob/0389aea0e0a745b61babdc0fdd18ac61098dfa84/README.md#L48-L63"
        },
        {
          "commit": "0389aea0e0a745b61babdc0fdd18ac61098dfa84",
          "git_sha": "52a479e4b19ffa90089f38fbe425bc4b3dbd794f",
          "line_end": 76,
          "line_start": 69,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "shyamsaktawat/openalpha_evolve",
          "url": "https://github.com/shyamsaktawat/OpenAlpha_Evolve/blob/0389aea0e0a745b61babdc0fdd18ac61098dfa84/README.md#L69-L76"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_4fe209d4ca4a043d68e1e601c79a2d6654bc8c54239aa47373393746c3a4c8d9",
        "slc_e3965f52b9375311b1fc82ce8eb44501334dffda290a2ed17ebffc9a37409835"
      ],
      "text": "Mutation and bug-fix prompts often request changes in diff format, and the code generator attempts to apply received diffs to the parent code; the features list describes diff-based mutations for targeted modifications."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_48c202c3ce22f3b37976a2cd5e94b20d6485fcba6b40620d8ae663c32e614a9a",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "tools-permissions",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "0389aea0e0a745b61babdc0fdd18ac61098dfa84",
          "git_sha": "52a479e4b19ffa90089f38fbe425bc4b3dbd794f",
          "line_end": 76,
          "line_start": 69,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "shyamsaktawat/openalpha_evolve",
          "url": "https://github.com/shyamsaktawat/OpenAlpha_Evolve/blob/0389aea0e0a745b61babdc0fdd18ac61098dfa84/README.md#L69-L76"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_e3965f52b9375311b1fc82ce8eb44501334dffda290a2ed17ebffc9a37409835"
      ],
      "text": "Per the README feature list, generated code is executed in Docker containers for sandboxed evaluation, with configurable timeout mechanisms."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_0470886912073b1ea830fb09cd8cfedfda1ccf6f349ad9204baa7357ea6a5c2c",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
