      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "0389aea0e0a745b61babdc0fdd18ac61098dfa84",
          "git_sha": "52a479e4b19ffa90089f38fbe425bc4b3dbd794f",
          "line_end": 63,
          "line_start": 48,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "shyamsaktawat/openalpha_evolve",
          "url": "https://github.com/shyamsaktawat/OpenAlpha_Evolve/blob/0389aea0e0a745b61babdc0fdd18ac61098dfa84/README.md#L48-L63"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_4fe209d4ca4a043d68e1e601c79a2d6654bc8c54239aa47373393746c3a4c8d9"
      ],
      "text": "The DatabaseAgent stores programs with code, fitness scores, generation, and lineage as a record of evolutionary history; the README notes this storage is currently in-memory."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_b79a1dc768c450e1c2cad875a871deee50bb57fb581b1e65bff04c336a67a628",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "evaluation",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "0389aea0e0a745b61babdc0fdd18ac61098dfa84",
          "git_sha": "52a479e4b19ffa90089f38fbe425bc4b3dbd794f",
          "line_end": 63,
          "line_start": 48,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "shyamsaktawat/openalpha_evolve",
          "url": "https://github.com/shyamsaktawat/OpenAlpha_Evolve/blob/0389aea0e0a745b61babdc0fdd18ac61098dfa84/README.md#L48-L63"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_4fe209d4ca4a043d68e1e601c79a2d6654bc8c54239aa47373393746c3a4c8d9"
      ],
      "text": "The EvaluatorAgent syntax-checks generated code, executes it in an isolated environment against task input/output examples, and scores fitness based on correctness (test cases passed), runtime efficiency, and other potential metrics."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_ecaa41cd141de451dc72c16f4ca94312bbdb29e0e16e2a60f65b482eddce663b",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "0389aea0e0a745b61babdc0fdd18ac61098dfa84",
          "git_sha": "52a479e4b19ffa90089f38fbe425bc4b3dbd794f",
          "line_end": 172,
          "line_start": 167,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "shyamsaktawat/openalpha_evolve",
          "url": "https://github.com/shyamsaktawat/OpenAlpha_Evolve/blob/0389aea0e0a745b61babdc0fdd18ac61098dfa84/README.md#L167-L172"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_7a2a024a1bbb8e4bf288841a287e68cd828b854d316b8973ae3d1fea31d288ec"
      ],
      "text": "A Gradio web interface is started with 'python app.py'; it displays a local URL (e.g., http://127.0.0.1:7860) and optionally a public share link, where users can define custom tasks and run evolution interactively."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_656ee61ec88e72d115cd2a81cab3dedc00b97cbb46480cc385bd7143abc55fff",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "0389aea0e0a745b61babdc0fdd18ac61098dfa84",
          "git_sha": "52a479e4b19ffa90089f38fbe425bc4b3dbd794f",
          "line_end": 165,
          "line_start": 160,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "shyamsaktawat/openalpha_evolve",
          "url": "https://github.com/shyamsaktawat/OpenAlpha_Evolve/blob/0389aea0e0a745b61babdc0fdd18ac61098dfa84/README.md#L160-L165"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_a741784eac64db5814d93fadfb26df99af2536c740206b740a9e6b9d8269f5be"
      ],
      "text": "The CLI entry point runs an evolutionary run via 'python -m main <task.yaml>' (e.g., examples/shortest_path.yaml), with logs also saved to alpha_evolve.log by default."
    },
    {
