      "text": "requirements.txt lists litellm, python-dotenv, PyYAML, tiktoken, openai, anthropic, google-generativeai, gradio, docker, Jinja2, pydantic, watchdog, termcolor, requests, and typing-extensions as core libraries, plus pytest."
    },
